1
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:11,220
The planet of Mordor.

2
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,410
I do not ask you to come with me, Sam.

3
00:00:58,460 --> 00:00:59,560
I know, Mr. Ford.

4
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:03,740
I doubt even these selfish
cloaks will art us in there.

5
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:06,260
No! No!

6
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,190
No! No, Master! They got you!

7
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:15,960
They got you! No! Don't take it to him!

8
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:24,750
There's another way. More secret.

9
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:28,110
A dark way. Why haven't
you spoken to this before?

10
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:29,930
Because Master did not ask.

11
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:34,260
He's up to something. Are you saying
there's another way into Mordor?

12
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:39,760
Yes. There's a path. And two stairs.

13
00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:41,700
And then...

14
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:44,840
...Tannan.

15
00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:48,740
Lead the way, Smeagol.
